Z||000000||trigger||08-07-2000||08:37 PM||||I was wondering if anybody knows if anybody makes a reproduction of the stock sub box.  It would be a real bonus if you could put a bigger speaker in it, but not a necessity.  Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.||||reg||1
Z||000001||rockcrawl||08-07-2000||09:23 PM||||I just sold an original sub, and I was thinking about how easy it would be to make a mold of it and reproduce them in fiberglass. They could be made for only a few dollars, and could be easily modified to use different size speakers. I can't believe nobody has done it yet. Personally I don't have the time to put into it right now, but I'm sure someone here does, and could make some big profits selling them.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'86 GT 3800 (for sale)<BR>'87 GT (noisey 2.8)<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)||||reg||3
